sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.GetAdvertisingAddress()
    alt Privacy disabled (or Advertise never called and still in standby)
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.AdvertisingAddress(<br>address=00:1A:7D:DA:71:13, addressType=publicAddress)
        Note over App: Returns the identity address.
    else Privacy enabled and Node has advertised at least once
        Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.AdvertisingAddress(<br>address=6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41, addressType=randomAddress)
        Note over App: Returns the resolvable private address currently in use.<br>Rotated periodically by the BLE stack.
    end
